WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Throttle butterfly
What it does: Controls the airflow opening according to accelerator position.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Throttle butterfly
How it works: The cable rotates the shaft and opens the plate.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Throttle butterfly
How it moves: Turns through part of a revolution to open or close the passage; does not turn at engine speed.
